<title>UK: Rise in Argentine dlr deposits cyclical - Minister.</title>
<headline>Rise in Argentine dlr deposits cyclical - Minister.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The growth in recent months in dollar deposits while those for pesos have fallen is merely cyclical and not the sign of any trend, Argentine Economy Minister Roque Ferandez said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>&quot;This is the sort of movement you see sometimes...I have no doubt that the cyclical movement...will reverse later on,&quot; he told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;I wouldn't consider that to be a trend,&quot; he added.</p>
<p>-- Jonathan Thatcher, London Newsroom +44 171 542 7770 (fax +44 171 583 7239)</p>
